{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01VzPAYLaSwrvaaiQ4CTrDjq","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# tally — Plans & Pricing\n2\t\n3\ttally is free to use on your own machine. The plans below apply only to the hosted\n4\tbackup add-on, which is optional.\n5\t\n6\t## Plans\n7\t\n8\t| Plan | Price | Expenses per month | Backup history |\n9\t|------|-------|--------------------|----------------|\n10\t| Free | $0 | up to 100 | 7 days |\n11\t| Plus | $3 / month | unlimited | 1 year |\n12\t| Family | $6 / month | unlimited | 3 years |\n13\t\n14\t## Notes\n15\t\n16\t- The **Free** plan lets you record up to **100 expenses per month**. If you record\n17\t  more, the extra expenses are still saved locally; they are simply not included in\n18\t  the hosted backup until you upgrade.\n19\t- Prices are in US dollars and billed monthly. There is no annual plan yet.\n20\t- Upgrading or downgrading takes effect at the start of the next billing month.\n21\t\n22\tIf the published limit here ever changes, remember that `docs/faq.md` quotes the\n23\tsame number and has to be updated to match (see requirements R6).\n24\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"454535cf-cc97-4f60-9c8f-3a4044271052","uuid":"958168db-2335-45d1-ba58-4a9e904af286","timestamp":"2026-07-05T16:20:59.753Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/sk/.cache/speech-acts-worktrees/rep2/t12-A/docs/pricing.md","content":"# tally — Plans & Pricing\n\ntally is free to use on your own machine. The plans below apply only to the hosted\nbackup add-on, which is optional.\n\n## Plans\n\n| Plan | Price | Expenses per month | Backup history |\n|------|-------|--------------------|----------------|\n| Free | $0 | up to 100 | 7 days |\n| Plus | $3 / month | unlimited | 1 year |\n| Family | $6 / month | unlimited | 3 years |\n\n## Notes\n\n- The **Free** plan lets you record up to **100 expenses per month**. If you record\n  more, the extra expenses are still saved locall